  "step_3": "The decision reason requires the individual to identify the sure outcome (minimum absolute value), compute the differences from that outcome, and evaluate the weighted sum of the sure outcome and these differences. The report does not mention any such calculation, nor does it refer to the sure outcome (0€ in B), differences (e.g., -1000€ deviation), or a weighted sum. Instead, the report references non-existent or misaligned monetary values (2000€, 1000€ as gift) and expresses subjective preferences without any reference to the structure of the decision reason. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason. The information considered and the justification provided are unrelated to the rule described in the decision reason. The final assessment is that the decision reason was not used.",
